{"1":{"w":[{"c":"قٓ","d":"qaf","e":"Qaf"},{"c":"وَالْقُرْءَانِ","d":"wal-qur'āni","e":"By the Quran"},{"c":"الْمَجِيدِ","d":"l-majīdi","e":"the Glorious"}],"a":{"g":"Qaf. By the honored Qur'an."}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"بَلْ","d":"bal","e":"Nay"},{"c":"عَجِبُوا","d":"ʿajibū","e":"they wonder"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"that"},{"c":"جَاءَهُمْ","d":"jāahum","e":"has come to them"},{"c":"مُنْذِرٌ","d":"mundhirun","e":"a warner"},{"c":"مِنْهُمْ","d":"min'hum","e":"from them"},{"c":"فَقَالَ","d":"faqāla","e":"So say"},{"c":"الْكَافِرُونَ","d":"l-kāfirūna","e":"the disbelievers"},{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"This"},{"c":"شَيْءٌ","d":"shayon","e":"(is) a thing"},{"c":"عَجِيبٌ","d":"ʿajībun","e":"amazing"}],"a":{"g":"But they wonder that there has come to them a warner from among themselves, and the disbelievers say, \"This is an amazing thing."}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"أَءِذَا","d":"a-idhā","e":"What! When"},{"c":"مِتْنَا","d":"mit'nā","e":"we die"},{"c":"وَكُنَّا","d":"wakunnā","e":"and have become"},{"c":"تُرَابًا","d":"turāban","e":"dust"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"That"},{"c":"رَجْعٌ","d":"rajʿun","e":"(is) a return"},{"c":"بَعِيدٌ","d":"baʿīdun","e":"far"}],"a":{"g":"When we have died and have become dust, [we will return to life]? That is a distant return.\""}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"قَدْ","d":"qad","e":"Certainly"},{"c":"عَلِمْنَا","d":"ʿalim'nā","e":"We know"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"تَنْقُصُ","d":"tanquṣu","e":"diminishes"},{"c":"الْأَرْضُ","d":"l-arḍu","e":"the earth"},{"c":"مِنْهُمْ","d":"min'hum","e":"of them"},{"c":"وَعِنْدَنَا","d":"waʿindanā","e":"and with Us"},{"c":"كِتَابٌ","d":"kitābun","e":"(is) a Book"},{"c":"حَفِيظٌ","d":"ḥafīẓun","e":"guarded"}],"a":{"g":"We know what the earth diminishes of them, and with Us is a retaining record."}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"بَلْ","d":"bal","e":"Nay"},{"c":"كَذَّبُوا","d":"kadhabū","e":"they denied"},{"c":"بِالْحَقِّ","d":"bil-ḥaqi","e":"the truth"},{"c":"لَمَّا","d":"lammā","e":"when"},{"c":"جَاءَهُمْ","d":"jāahum","e":"it came (to) them"},{"c":"فَهُمْ","d":"fahum","e":"so they"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(are) in"},{"c":"أَمْرٍ","d":"amrin","e":"a state"},{"c":"مَرِيجٍ","d":"marījin","e":"confused"}],"a":{"g":"But they denied the truth when it came to them, so they are in a confused condition."}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"أَفَلَمْ","d":"afalam","e":"Then do not"},{"c":"يَنْظُرُوا","d":"yanẓurū","e":"they look"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"at"},{"c":"السَّمَاءِ","d":"l-samāi","e":"the sky"},{"c":"فَوْقَهُمْ","d":"fawqahum","e":"above them"},{"c":"كَيْفَ","d":"kayfa","e":"how"},{"c":"بَنَيْنَاهَا","d":"banaynāhā","e":"We structured it"},{"c":"وَزَيَّنَّاهَا","d":"wazayyannāhā","e":"and adorned it"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and not"},{"c":"لَهَا","d":"lahā","e":"for it"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"فُرُوجٍ","d":"furūjin","e":"rifts"}],"a":{"g":"Have they not looked at the heaven above them - how We structured it and adorned it and [how] it has no rifts?"}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"وَالْأَرْضَ","d":"wal-arḍa","e":"And the earth"},{"c":"مَدَدْنَاهَا","d":"madadnāhā","e":"We have spread it out"},{"c":"وَأَلْقَيْنَا","d":"wa-alqaynā","e":"and cast"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"رَوَاسِيَ","d":"rawāsiya","e":"firmly set mountains"},{"c":"وَأَنْبَتْنَا","d":"wa-anbatnā","e":"and We made to grow"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"كُلِّ","d":"kulli","e":"every"},{"c":"زَوْجٍ","d":"zawjin","e":"kind"},{"c":"بَهِيجٍ","d":"bahījin","e":"beautiful"}],"a":{"g":"And the earth - We spread it out and cast therein firmly set mountains and made grow therein [something] of every beautiful kind,"}},"8":{"w":[{"c":"تَبْصِرَةً","d":"tabṣiratan","e":"Giving insight"},{"c":"وَذِكْرَى","d":"wadhik'rā","e":"and a reminder"},{"c":"لِكُلِّ","d":"likulli","e":"for every"},{"c":"عَبْدٍ","d":"ʿabdin","e":"slave"},{"c":"مُنِيبٍ","d":"munībin","e":"who turns"}],"a":{"g":"Giving insight and a reminder for every servant who turns [to Allah]."}},"9":{"w":[{"c":"وَنَزَّلْنَا","d":"wanazzalnā","e":"And We have sent down"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"from"},{"c":"السَّمَاءِ","d":"l-samāi","e":"the sky"},{"c":"مَاءً","d":"māan","e":"water"},{"c":"مُبَارَكًا","d":"mubārakan","e":"blessed"},{"c":"فَأَنْبَتْنَا","d":"fa-anbatnā","e":"then We made to grow"},{"c":"بِهِ","d":"bihi","e":"thereby"},{"c":"جَنَّاتٍ","d":"jannātin","e":"gardens"},{"c":"وَحَبَّ","d":"waḥabba","e":"and grain"},{"c":"الْحَصِيدِ","d":"l-ḥaṣīdi","e":"(for) the harvest"}],"a":{"g":"And We have sent down blessed rain from the sky and made grow thereby gardens and grain from the harvest"}},"10":{"w":[{"c":"وَالنَّخْلَ","d":"wal-nakhla","e":"And the palms trees"},{"c":"بَاسِقَاتٍ","d":"bāsiqātin","e":"tall"},{"c":"لَهَا","d":"lahā","e":"for it"},{"c":"طَلْعٌ","d":"ṭalʿun","e":"(are) layers"},{"c":"نَضِيدٌ","d":"naḍīdun","e":"arranged"}],"a":{"g":"And lofty palm trees having fruit arranged in layers -"}},"11":{"w":[{"c":"رِزْقًا","d":"riz'qan","e":"A provision"},{"c":"لِلْعِبَادِ","d":"lil'ʿibādi","e":"for the slaves"},{"c":"وَأَحْيَيْنَا","d":"wa-aḥyaynā","e":"and We give life"},{"c":"بِهِ","d":"bihi","e":"therewith"},{"c":"بَلْدَةً","d":"baldatan","e":"(to) a land"},{"c":"مَيْتًا","d":"maytan","e":"dead"},{"c":"كَذَلِكَ","d":"kadhālika","e":"Thus"},{"c":"الْخُرُوجُ","d":"l-khurūju","e":"(will be) the coming forth"}],"a":{"g":"As provision for the servants, and We have given life thereby to a dead land. Thus is the resurrection."}},"12":{"w":[{"c":"كَذَّبَتْ","d":"kadhabat","e":"Denied"},{"c":"قَبْلَهُمْ","d":"qablahum","e":"before them"},{"c":"قَوْمُ","d":"qawmu","e":"(the) people"},{"c":"نُوحٍ","d":"nūḥin","e":"(of) Nuh"},{"c":"وَأَصْحَابُ","d":"wa-aṣḥābu","e":"and (the) companions"},{"c":"الرَّسِّ","d":"l-rasi","e":"(of) Ar-Raas"},{"c":"وَثَمُودُ","d":"wathamūdu","e":"and Thamud"}],"a":{"g":"The people of Noah denied before them, and the companions of the well and Thamud"}},"13":{"w":[{"c":"وَعَادٌ","d":"waʿādun","e":"And Aad"},{"c":"وَفِرْعَوْنُ","d":"wafir'ʿawnu","e":"and Firaun"},{"c":"وَإِخْوَانُ","d":"wa-ikh'wānu","e":"and (the) brothers"},{"c":"لُوطٍ","d":"lūṭin","e":"(of) Lut"}],"a":{"g":"And 'Aad and Pharaoh and the brothers of Lot"}},"14":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَصْحَابُ","d":"wa-aṣḥābu","e":"And (the) companions"},{"c":"الْأَيْكَةِ","d":"l-aykati","e":"(of) the wood"},{"c":"وَقَوْمُ","d":"waqawmu","e":"and (the) people"},{"c":"تُبَّعٍ","d":"tubbaʿin","e":"(of) Tubba"},{"c":"كُلٌّ","d":"kullun","e":"All"},{"c":"كَذَّبَ","d":"kadhaba","e":"denied"},{"c":"الرُّسُلَ","d":"l-rusula","e":"the Messengers"},{"c":"فَحَقَّ","d":"faḥaqqa","e":"so was fulfilled"},{"c":"وَعِيدِ","d":"waʿīdi","e":"My Threat"}],"a":{"g":"And the companions of the thicket and the people of Tubba'. All denied the messengers, so My threat was justly fulfilled."}},"15":{"w":[{"c":"أَفَعَيِينَا","d":"afaʿayīnā","e":"Were We then tired"},{"c":"بِالْخَلْقِ","d":"bil-khalqi","e":"with the creation"},{"c":"الْأَوَّلِ","d":"l-awali","e":"the first"},{"c":"بَلْ","d":"bal","e":"Nay"},{"c":"هُمْ","d":"hum","e":"they"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(are) in"},{"c":"لَبْسٍ","d":"labsin","e":"doubt"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"about"},{"c":"خَلْقٍ","d":"khalqin","e":"a creation"},{"c":"جَدِيدٍ","d":"jadīdin","e":"new"}],"a":{"g":"Did We fail in the first creation? But they are in confusion over a new creation."}},"16":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَقَدْ","d":"walaqad","e":"And certainly"},{"c":"خَلَقْنَا","d":"khalaqnā","e":"We created"},{"c":"الْإِنْسَانَ","d":"l-insāna","e":"man"},{"c":"وَنَعْلَمُ","d":"wanaʿlamu","e":"and We know"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"تُوَسْوِسُ","d":"tuwaswisu","e":"whispers"},{"c":"بِهِ","d":"bihi","e":"to him"},{"c":"نَفْسُهُ","d":"nafsuhu","e":"his soul"},{"c":"وَنَحْنُ","d":"wanaḥnu","e":"and We"},{"c":"أَقْرَبُ","d":"aqrabu","e":"(are) nearer"},{"c":"إِلَيْهِ","d":"ilayhi","e":"to him"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"than"},{"c":"حَبْلِ","d":"ḥabli","e":"(his) jugular vein"},{"c":"الْوَرِيدِ","d":"l-warīdi","e":"(his) jugular vein"}],"a":{"g":"And We have already created man and know what his soul whispers to him, and We are closer to him than [his] jugular vein"}},"17":{"w":[{"c":"إِذْ","d":"idh","e":"When"},{"c":"يَتَلَقَّى","d":"yatalaqqā","e":"receive"},{"c":"الْمُتَلَقِّيَانِ","d":"l-mutalaqiyāni","e":"the two receivers"},{"c":"عَنِ","d":"ʿani","e":"on"},{"c":"الْيَمِينِ","d":"l-yamīni","e":"the right"},{"c":"وَعَنِ","d":"waʿani","e":"and on"},{"c":"الشِّمَالِ","d":"l-shimāli","e":"the left"},{"c":"قَعِيدٌ","d":"qaʿīdun","e":"seated"}],"a":{"g":"When the two receivers receive, seated on the right and on the left."}},"18":{"w":[{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"Not"},{"c":"يَلْفِظُ","d":"yalfiẓu","e":"he utters"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"قَوْلٍ","d":"qawlin","e":"word"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"but"},{"c":"لَدَيْهِ","d":"ladayhi","e":"with him"},{"c":"رَقِيبٌ","d":"raqībun","e":"(is) an observer"},{"c":"عَتِيدٌ","d":"ʿatīdun","e":"ready"}],"a":{"g":"Man does not utter any word except that with him is an observer prepared [to record]."}},"19":{"w":[{"c":"وَجَاءَتْ","d":"wajāat","e":"And will come"},{"c":"سَكْرَةُ","d":"sakratu","e":"(the) stupor"},{"c":"الْمَوْتِ","d":"l-mawti","e":"(of) death"},{"c":"بِالْحَقِّ","d":"bil-ḥaqi","e":"in truth"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"That"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"(is) what"},{"c":"كُنْتَ","d":"kunta","e":"you were"},{"c":"مِنْهُ","d":"min'hu","e":"[from it]"},{"c":"تَحِيدُ","d":"taḥīdu","e":"avoiding"}],"a":{"g":"And the intoxication of death will bring the truth; that is what you were trying to avoid."}},"20":{"w":[{"c":"وَنُفِخَ","d":"wanufikha","e":"And will be blown"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"[in]"},{"c":"الصُّورِ","d":"l-ṣūri","e":"the trumpet"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"That"},{"c":"يَوْمُ","d":"yawmu","e":"(is the) Day"},{"c":"الْوَعِيدِ","d":"l-waʿīdi","e":"(of) the Warning"}],"a":{"g":"And the Horn will be blown. That is the Day of [carrying out] the threat."}},"21":{"w":[{"c":"وَجَاءَتْ","d":"wajāat","e":"And will come"},{"c":"كُلُّ","d":"kullu","e":"every"},{"c":"نَفْسٍ","d":"nafsin","e":"soul"},{"c":"مَعَهَا","d":"maʿahā","e":"with it"},{"c":"سَائِقٌ","d":"sāiqun","e":"a driver"},{"c":"وَشَهِيدٌ","d":"washahīdun","e":"and a witness"}],"a":{"g":"And every soul will come, with it a driver and a witness."}},"22":{"w":[{"c":"لَقَدْ","d":"laqad","e":"Certainly"},{"c":"كُنْتَ","d":"kunta","e":"you were"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"غَفْلَةٍ","d":"ghaflatin","e":"heedlessness"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"this"},{"c":"فَكَشَفْنَا","d":"fakashafnā","e":"So We have removed"},{"c":"عَنْكَ","d":"ʿanka","e":"from you"},{"c":"غِطَاءَكَ","d":"ghiṭāaka","e":"your cover"},{"c":"فَبَصَرُكَ","d":"fabaṣaruka","e":"so your sight"},{"c":"الْيَوْمَ","d":"l-yawma","e":"today"},{"c":"حَدِيدٌ","d":"ḥadīdun","e":"(is) sharp"}],"a":{"g":"[It will be said], \"You were certainly in unmindfulness of this, and We have removed from you your cover, so your sight, this Day, is sharp.\""}},"23":{"w":[{"c":"وَقَالَ","d":"waqāla","e":"And (will) say"},{"c":"قَرِينُهُ","d":"qarīnuhu","e":"his companion"},{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"This"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"(is) what"},{"c":"لَدَيَّ","d":"ladayya","e":"(is) with me"},{"c":"عَتِيدٌ","d":"ʿatīdun","e":"ready"}],"a":{"g":"And his companion, [the angel], will say, \"This [record] is what is with me, prepared.\""}},"24":{"w":[{"c":"أَلْقِيَا","d":"alqiyā","e":"Throw"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"into"},{"c":"جَهَنَّمَ","d":"jahannama","e":"Hell"},{"c":"كُلَّ","d":"kulla","e":"every"},{"c":"كَفَّارٍ","d":"kaffārin","e":"disbeliever"},{"c":"عَنِيدٍ","d":"ʿanīdin","e":"stubborn"}],"a":{"g":"[Allah will say], \"Throw into Hell every obstinate disbeliever,"}},"25":{"w":[{"c":"مَنَّاعٍ","d":"mannāʿin","e":"Forbidder"},{"c":"لِلْخَيْرِ","d":"lil'khayri","e":"of good"},{"c":"مُعْتَدٍ","d":"muʿ'tadin","e":"transgressor"},{"c":"مُرِيبٍ","d":"murībin","e":"doubter"}],"a":{"g":"Preventer of good, aggressor, and doubter,"}},"26":{"w":[{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"Who"},{"c":"جَعَلَ","d":"jaʿala","e":"made"},{"c":"مَعَ","d":"maʿa","e":"with"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"Allah"},{"c":"إِلَهًا","d":"ilāhan","e":"a god"},{"c":"ءَاخَرَ","d":"ākhara","e":"another"},{"c":"فَأَلْقِيَاهُ","d":"fa-alqiyāhu","e":"so throw him"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in(to)"},{"c":"الْعَذَابِ","d":"l-ʿadhābi","e":"the punishment"},{"c":"الشَّدِيدِ","d":"l-shadīdi","e":"the severe"}],"a":{"g":"Who made [as equal] with Allah another deity; then throw him into the severe punishment.\""}},"27":{"w":[{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"Will say"},{"c":"قَرِينُهُ","d":"qarīnuhu","e":"his companion"},{"c":"رَبَّنَا","d":"rabbanā","e":"Our Lord"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"not"},{"c":"أَطْغَيْتُهُ","d":"aṭghaytuhu","e":"I made him transgress"},{"c":"وَلَكِنْ","d":"walākin","e":"but"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"he was"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"ضَلَالٍ","d":"ḍalālin","e":"error"},{"c":"بَعِيدٍ","d":"baʿīdin","e":"far"}],"a":{"g":"His [devil] companion will say, \"Our Lord, I did not make him transgress, but he [himself] was in extreme error.\""}},"28":{"w":[{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"He will say"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(Do) not"},{"c":"تَخْتَصِمُوا","d":"takhtaṣimū","e":"dispute"},{"c":"لَدَيَّ","d":"ladayya","e":"(in) My presence"},{"c":"وَقَدْ","d":"waqad","e":"and indeed"},{"c":"قَدَّمْتُ","d":"qaddamtu","e":"I sent forth"},{"c":"إِلَيْكُمْ","d":"ilaykum","e":"to you"},{"c":"بِالْوَعِيدِ","d":"bil-waʿīdi","e":"the Warning"}],"a":{"g":"[Allah] will say, \"Do not dispute before Me, while I had already presented to you the warning."}},"29":{"w":[{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"Not"},{"c":"يُبَدَّلُ","d":"yubaddalu","e":"will be changed"},{"c":"الْقَوْلُ","d":"l-qawlu","e":"the word"},{"c":"لَدَيَّ","d":"ladayya","e":"with Me"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and not"},{"c":"أَنَا","d":"anā","e":"I Am"},{"c":"بِظَلَّامٍ","d":"biẓallāmin","e":"unjust"},{"c":"لِلْعَبِيدِ","d":"lil'ʿabīdi","e":"to My slaves"}],"a":{"g":"The word will not be changed with Me, and never will I be unjust to the servants.\""}},"30":{"w":[{"c":"يَوْمَ","d":"yawma","e":"(The) Day"},{"c":"نَقُولُ","d":"naqūlu","e":"We will say"},{"c":"لِجَهَنَّمَ","d":"lijahannama","e":"to Hell"},{"c":"هَلِ","d":"hali","e":"Are"},{"c":"امْتَلَأْتِ","d":"im'talati","e":"you filled"},{"c":"وَتَقُولُ","d":"wataqūlu","e":"And it will say"},{"c":"هَلْ","d":"hal","e":"Are"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"(there) any"},{"c":"مَزِيدٍ","d":"mazīdin","e":"more"}],"a":{"g":"On the Day We will say to Hell, \"Have you been filled?\" and it will say, \"Are there some more,\""}},"31":{"w":[{"c":"وَأُزْلِفَتِ","d":"wa-uz'lifati","e":"And will be brought near"},{"c":"الْجَنَّةُ","d":"l-janatu","e":"the Paradise"},{"c":"لِلْمُتَّقِينَ","d":"lil'muttaqīna","e":"to the righteous"},{"c":"غَيْرَ","d":"ghayra","e":"not"},{"c":"بَعِيدٍ","d":"baʿīdin","e":"far"}],"a":{"g":"And Paradise will be brought near to the righteous, not far,"}},"32":{"w":[{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"This"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"(is) what"},{"c":"تُوعَدُونَ","d":"tūʿadūna","e":"you were promised"},{"c":"لِكُلِّ","d":"likulli","e":"for everyone"},{"c":"أَوَّابٍ","d":"awwābin","e":"who turns"},{"c":"حَفِيظٍ","d":"ḥafīẓin","e":"(and) who keeps"}],"a":{"g":"[It will be said], \"This is what you were promised - for every returner [to Allah] and keeper [of His covenant]"}},"33":{"w":[{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"Who"},{"c":"خَشِيَ","d":"khashiya","e":"feared"},{"c":"الرَّحْمَنَ","d":"l-raḥmāna","e":"the Most Gracious"},{"c":"بِالْغَيْبِ","d":"bil-ghaybi","e":"in the unseen"},{"c":"وَجَاءَ","d":"wajāa","e":"and came"},{"c":"بِقَلْبٍ","d":"biqalbin","e":"with a heart"},{"c":"مُنِيبٍ","d":"munībin","e":"returning"}],"a":{"g":"Who feared the Most Merciful unseen and came with a heart returning [in repentance]."}},"34":{"w":[{"c":"ادْخُلُوهَا","d":"ud'khulūhā","e":"Enter it"},{"c":"بِسَلَامٍ","d":"bisalāmin","e":"in peace"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"That"},{"c":"يَوْمُ","d":"yawmu","e":"(is) a Day"},{"c":"الْخُلُودِ","d":"l-khulūdi","e":"(of) Eternity"}],"a":{"g":"Enter it in peace. This is the Day of Eternity.\""}},"35":{"w":[{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"For them"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"whatever"},{"c":"يَشَاءُونَ","d":"yashāūna","e":"they wish"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"وَلَدَيْنَا","d":"waladaynā","e":"and with Us"},{"c":"مَزِيدٌ","d":"mazīdun","e":"(is) more"}],"a":{"g":"They will have whatever they wish therein, and with Us is more."}},"36":{"w":[{"c":"وَكَمْ","d":"wakam","e":"And how many"},{"c":"أَهْلَكْنَا","d":"ahlaknā","e":"We destroyed"},{"c":"قَبْلَهُمْ","d":"qablahum","e":"before them"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"قَرْنٍ","d":"qarnin","e":"a generation"},{"c":"هُمْ","d":"hum","e":"they"},{"c":"أَشَدُّ","d":"ashaddu","e":"(were) stronger"},{"c":"مِنْهُمْ","d":"min'hum","e":"than them"},{"c":"بَطْشًا","d":"baṭshan","e":"(in) power"},{"c":"فَنَقَّبُوا","d":"fanaqqabū","e":"so they explored"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"throughout"},{"c":"الْبِلَادِ","d":"l-bilādi","e":"the lands"},{"c":"هَلْ","d":"hal","e":"Is (there)"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"مَحِيصٍ","d":"maḥīṣin","e":"place of escape"}],"a":{"g":"And how many a generation before them did We destroy who were greater than them in [striking] power and had explored throughout the lands. Is there any place of escape?"}},"37":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"that"},{"c":"لَذِكْرَى","d":"ladhik'rā","e":"surely, is a reminder"},{"c":"لِمَنْ","d":"liman","e":"for (one) who"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"is"},{"c":"لَهُ","d":"lahu","e":"for him"},{"c":"قَلْبٌ","d":"qalbun","e":"a heart"},{"c":"أَوْ","d":"aw","e":"or"},{"c":"أَلْقَى","d":"alqā","e":"(who) gives ear"},{"c":"السَّمْعَ","d":"l-samʿa","e":"(who) gives ear"},{"c":"وَهُوَ","d":"wahuwa","e":"while he"},{"c":"شَهِيدٌ","d":"shahīdun","e":"(is) a witness"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed in that is a reminder for whoever has a heart or who listens while he is present [in mind]."}},"38":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَقَدْ","d":"walaqad","e":"And certainly"},{"c":"خَلَقْنَا","d":"khalaqnā","e":"We created"},{"c":"السَّمَاوَاتِ","d":"l-samāwāti","e":"the heavens"},{"c":"وَالْأَرْضَ","d":"wal-arḍa","e":"and the earth"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and whatever"},{"c":"بَيْنَهُمَا","d":"baynahumā","e":"(is) between both of them"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"سِتَّةِ","d":"sittati","e":"six"},{"c":"أَيَّامٍ","d":"ayyāmin","e":"periods"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and (did) not"},{"c":"مَسَّنَا","d":"massanā","e":"touch Us"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"لُغُوبٍ","d":"lughūbin","e":"fatigue"}],"a":{"g":"And We did certainly create the heavens and earth and what is between them in six days, and there touched Us no weariness."}},"39":{"w":[{"c":"فَاصْبِرْ","d":"fa-iṣ'bir","e":"So be patient"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"over"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"يَقُولُونَ","d":"yaqūlūna","e":"they say"},{"c":"وَسَبِّحْ","d":"wasabbiḥ","e":"and glorify"},{"c":"بِحَمْدِ","d":"biḥamdi","e":"(the) praise"},{"c":"رَبِّكَ","d":"rabbika","e":"(of) your Lord"},{"c":"قَبْلَ","d":"qabla","e":"before"},{"c":"طُلُوعِ","d":"ṭulūʿi","e":"(the) rising"},{"c":"الشَّمْسِ","d":"l-shamsi","e":"(of) the sun"},{"c":"وَقَبْلَ","d":"waqabla","e":"and before"},{"c":"الْغُرُوبِ","d":"l-ghurūbi","e":"the setting"}],"a":{"g":"So be patient, [O Muhammad], over what they say and exalt [Allah] with praise of your Lord before the rising of the sun and before its setting,"}},"40":{"w":[{"c":"وَمِنَ","d":"wamina","e":"And of"},{"c":"اللَّيْلِ","d":"al-layli","e":"the night"},{"c":"فَسَبِّحْهُ","d":"fasabbiḥ'hu","e":"glorify Him"},{"c":"وَأَدْبَارَ","d":"wa-adbāra","e":"and after"},{"c":"السُّجُودِ","d":"l-sujūdi","e":"the prostration"}],"a":{"g":"And [in part] of the night exalt Him and after prostration."}},"41":{"w":[{"c":"وَاسْتَمِعْ","d":"wa-is'tamiʿ","e":"And listen!"},{"c":"يَوْمَ","d":"yawma","e":"(The) Day"},{"c":"يُنَادِ","d":"yunādi","e":"will call"},{"c":"الْمُنَادِ","d":"l-munādi","e":"the caller"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"مَكَانٍ","d":"makānin","e":"a place"},{"c":"قَرِيبٍ","d":"qarībin","e":"near"}],"a":{"g":"And listen on the Day when the Caller will call out from a place that is near -"}},"42":{"w":[{"c":"يَوْمَ","d":"yawma","e":"(The) Day"},{"c":"يَسْمَعُونَ","d":"yasmaʿūna","e":"they will hear"},{"c":"الصَّيْحَةَ","d":"l-ṣayḥata","e":"the Blast"},{"c":"بِالْحَقِّ","d":"bil-ḥaqi","e":"in truth"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"That"},{"c":"يَوْمُ","d":"yawmu","e":"(is the) Day"},{"c":"الْخُرُوجِ","d":"l-khurūji","e":"(of) coming forth"}],"a":{"g":"The Day they will hear the blast [of the Horn] in truth. That is the Day of Emergence [from the graves]."}},"43":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed We"},{"c":"نَحْنُ","d":"naḥnu","e":"[We]"},{"c":"نُحْيِي","d":"nuḥ'yī","e":"[We] give life"},{"c":"وَنُمِيتُ","d":"wanumītu","e":"and [We] cause death"},{"c":"وَإِلَيْنَا","d":"wa-ilaynā","e":"and to Us"},{"c":"الْمَصِيرُ","d":"l-maṣīru","e":"(is) the final return"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, it is We who give life and cause death, and to Us is the destination"}},"44":{"w":[{"c":"يَوْمَ","d":"yawma","e":"(The) Day"},{"c":"تَشَقَّقُ","d":"tashaqqaqu","e":"will split"},{"c":"الْأَرْضُ","d":"l-arḍu","e":"the earth"},{"c":"عَنْهُمْ","d":"ʿanhum","e":"from them"},{"c":"سِرَاعًا","d":"sirāʿan","e":"hurrying"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"That"},{"c":"حَشْرٌ","d":"ḥashrun","e":"(is) a gathering"},{"c":"عَلَيْنَا","d":"ʿalaynā","e":"for Us"},{"c":"يَسِيرٌ","d":"yasīrun","e":"easy"}],"a":{"g":"On the Day the earth breaks away from them [and they emerge] rapidly; that is a gathering easy for Us."}},"45":{"w":[{"c":"نَحْنُ","d":"naḥnu","e":"We"},{"c":"أَعْلَمُ","d":"aʿlamu","e":"know best"},{"c":"بِمَا","d":"bimā","e":"[of] what"},{"c":"يَقُولُونَ","d":"yaqūlūna","e":"they say"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and not"},{"c":"أَنْتَ","d":"anta","e":"(are) you"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِمْ","d":"ʿalayhim","e":"over them"},{"c":"بِجَبَّارٍ","d":"bijabbārin","e":"the one to compel"},{"c":"فَذَكِّرْ","d":"fadhakkir","e":"But remind"},{"c":"بِالْقُرْءَانِ","d":"bil-qur'āni","e":"with the Quran"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"whoever"},{"c":"يَخَافُ","d":"yakhāfu","e":"fears"},{"c":"وَعِيدِ","d":"waʿīdi","e":"My threat"}],"a":{"g":"We are most knowing of what they say, and you are not over them a tyrant. But remind by the Qur'an whoever fears My threat."}}}